cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Feature Monitor: drift alerts from sparse autoencoder features"
abstract: >-
  A production-style monitor that encodes a language model's activations with a sparse
  autoencoder, stores each request's top 20 features, and raises drift alerts, compared against
  the same drift test on prompt sentence embeddings with GPT-2 Small and Gemma 2 2B.
authors:
